{"id":67386,"date":"2025-02-16T19:42:50","date_gmt":"2025-02-16T18:42:50","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67386"},"modified":"2026-09-14T12:02:49","modified_gmt":"2026-09-14T11:02:49","slug":"trail-lagoa-de-obidos","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-lagoa-de-obidos\/","title":{"rendered":"1\u00ba Trail Trilhos da Lagoa de Obidos 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">1\u00ba Trail Trilhos da Lagoa de Obidos 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>1\u00ba Trail Trilhos da Lagoa de Obidos 2026<\/strong> \u00e9 um evento desportivo em plena Natureza organizado pelo <strong>Arelho Running Team<\/strong>, com partida e centro log\u00edstico sediados no <strong>Centro Cultural, Social e Recreativo Arelhense<\/strong>, na freguesia do Arelho, concelho de <strong>\u00d3bidos<\/strong>. Agendado para domingo, <strong>6 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, este desafio convida-te a explorar cen\u00e1rios \u00edmpares entre trilhos florestais, linhas de \u00e1gua e as margens emblem\u00e1ticas da <strong>Lagoa de \u00d3bidos<\/strong>, proporcionando sensa\u00e7\u00f5es aut\u00eanticas de supera\u00e7\u00e3o e contacto com a biodiversidade do Oeste.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa integra tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias adaptadas a diferentes perfis de atletas: o competitivo <strong>Trail Curto de 22 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s 09:00), o acess\u00edvel e din\u00e2mico <strong>Mini Trail de 12 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s 09:30) e a agrad\u00e1vel <strong>Caminhada de 8 km<\/strong> (partida \u00e0s 09:40). Todas as provas de corrida disp\u00f5em de cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica por chip da Recorde Pessoal, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, lembran\u00e7a finisher, banhos e a tradicional refei\u00e7\u00e3o final de conv\u00edvio (p\u00e3o com chouri\u00e7o e bebida), com t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial alusiva ao evento dispon\u00edvel como op\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; t